<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="tr">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <title>{{ identifier }} - {{ project.name }} {{ release.version }}</title>
  <style>
    @page {
      size: A4;
      margin: 20mm;
    }
    body {
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;
      color: #1f2937;
      line-height: 1.5;
      font-size: 13px;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 24px;
    }
    header {
      border-bottom: 2px solid #1d4ed8;
      padding-bottom: 12px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }
    h1 {
      margin: 0 0 6px 0;
      font-size: 22px;
      color: #111827;
    }
    h2 {
      margin-top: 22px;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
      font-size: 16px;
      color: #1e40af;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
      padding-bottom: 4px;
    }
    .meta {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 16px;
      font-size: 12px;
      color: #4b5563;
    }
    .badge {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 2px 8px;
      border-radius: 4px;
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 11px;
      background: #dbeafe;
      color: #1e40af;
    }
    .badge-pass {
      background: #dcfce7;
      color: #166534;
    }
    .badge-fail {
      background: #fee2e2;
      color: #991b1b;
    }
    .section-box {
      background: #f9fafb;
      border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
      border-radius: 6px;
      padding: 10px 14px;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }
    .metrics-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
      gap: 10px;
      margin-top: 8px;
      margin-bottom: 14px;
    }
    .metric-card {
      border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
      border-radius: 6px;
      padding: 8px 12px;
      background: #f9fafb;
    }
    .metric-label {
      font-size: 11px;
      color: #6b7280;
    }
    .metric-value {
      font-size: 16px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #111827;
    }
    table {
      width: 100%;
      border-collapse: collapse;
      margin-top: 8px;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
      font-size: 12px;
    }
    th, td {
      border: 1px solid #d1d5db;
      padding: 6px 8px;
      text-align: left;
      vertical-align: top;
    }
    th {
      background: #f3f4f6;
      font-weight: 600;
    }
    footer {
      margin-top: 28px;
      padding-top: 10px;
      border-top: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
      font-size: 11px;
      color: #6b7280;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <h1>IEEE 829 Test Summary Report · {{ identifier }}</h1>
    <div class="meta">
      <span><strong>Rapor ID:</strong> {{ identifier }}</span>
      <span><strong>Proje:</strong> {{ project.name }}</span>
      <span><strong>Sürüm (Release):</strong> {{ release.version }}</span>
      <span><strong>Sürüm Durumu:</strong> <span class="badge">{{ release.status }}</span></span>
      <span>
        <strong>Çıkış Kapısı (Release Gate):</strong>
        <span class="badge {{ 'badge-pass' if gate.gate_passed else 'badge-fail' }}">
          {{ "GEÇTİ (PASSED)" if gate.gate_passed else "ENGELLİ (BLOCKED)" }}
        </span>
      </span>
      <span><strong>Üreten:</strong> {{ generated_by }}</span>
      <span><strong>Üretim Zamanı:</strong> {{ generated_at }}</span>
    </div>
  </header>

  <section>
    <h2>1. Test Summary Report Tanımlayıcısı ve Kapsamı (IEEE 829 / ISO/IEC/IEEE 29119-3)</h2>
    <div class="section-box">
      <p>
        Bu doküman <strong>{{ identifier }}</strong> koduyla <strong>{{ project.name }}</strong> projesinin
        <strong>{{ release.version }}</strong> sürümü için IEEE 829 Test Summary Report ve
        ISO/IEC/IEEE 29119-3 Test Completion Report maddelerine (toplam sonuçlar, özellik/gereksinim
        bazında sonuçlar, defect özeti ve sürüm çıkış kriteri değerlendirmesi) uygun olarak üretilmiştir.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>2. Sürüm Test Toplamları ve Yürütme Özeti (Overall Totals)</h2>
    <div class="metrics-grid">
      <div class="metric-card">
        <div class="metric-label">Toplam Test Vakası / Koşum</div>
        <div class="metric-value">{{ totals.total_cases }} vaka / {{ totals.run_count }} koşum</div>
      </div>
      <div class="metric-card">
        <div class="metric-label">Koşum Oranı (Execution Rate)</div>
        <div class="metric-value">%{{ totals.execution_rate }} ({{ totals.executed_cases }}/{{ totals.total_cases }})</div>
      </div>
      <div class="metric-card">
        <div class="metric-label">Başarı Oranı (Pass Rate)</div>
        <div class="metric-value">%{{ totals.pass_rate }} ({{ totals.passed }}P / {{ totals.failed }}F)</div>
      </div>
      <div class="metric-card">
        <div class="metric-label">Gereksinim Kapsamı</div>
        <div class="metric-value">%{{ totals.requirement_coverage }} ({{ totals.covered_requirements }}/{{ totals.total_requirements }})</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <table>
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th>Passed</th>
          <th>Failed</th>
          <th>Blocked</th>
          <th>Skipped</th>
          <th>Not Run</th>
          <th>Sürüm Koşum Yürütmeleri</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr>
          <td><strong>{{ totals.passed }}</strong></td>
          <td><strong>{{ totals.failed }}</strong></td>
          <td>{{ totals.blocked }}</td>
          <td>{{ totals.skipped }}</td>
          <td>{{ totals.not_run }}</td>
          <td>{{ totals.release_execution_count }} yürütme ({{ totals.run_count }} koşum)</td>
        </tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>3. Özellik / Gereksinim Bazında Test Sonuçları (Results by Requirement &amp; Suite)</h2>
    <table>
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th>Gereksinim</th>
          <th>Başlık</th>
          <th>Bağlı Vaka Sayısı</th>
          <th>Passed</th>
          <th>Failed</th>
          <th>Blocked</th>
          <th>Skipped</th>
          <th>Not Run</th>
          <th>Değerlendirme</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        {% for req in feature_results %}
        <tr>
          <td><strong>{{ req.id }}</strong></td>
          <td>{{ req.title }}</td>
          <td>{{ req.total_cases }} ({{ req.test_cases | join(", ") if req.test_cases else "-" }})</td>
          <td>{{ req.passed }}</td>
          <td>{{ req.failed }}</td>
          <td>{{ req.blocked }}</td>
          <td>{{ req.skipped }}</td>
          <td>{{ req.not_run }}</td>
          <td>{{ req.assessment }}</td>
        </tr>
        {% else %}
        <tr>
          <td colspan="9">Projede kayıtlı gereksinim bulunmuyor.</td>
        </tr>
        {% endfor %}
      </tbody>
    </table>

    {% if suite_results %}
    <table>
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th>Test Suite</th>
          <th>Açıklama</th>
          <th>Toplam Vaka</th>
          <th>Passed</th>
          <th>Failed</th>
          <th>Blocked / Skipped / Not Run</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        {% for s in suite_results %}
        <tr>
          <td><strong>{{ s.name }}</strong></td>
          <td>{{ s.description or "-" }}</td>
          <td>{{ s.total_cases }}</td>
          <td>{{ s.passed }}</td>
          <td>{{ s.failed }}</td>
          <td>{{ s.blocked }} / {{ s.skipped }} / {{ s.not_run }}</td>
        </tr>
        {% endfor %}
      </tbody>
    </table>
    {% endif %}
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>4. Defect Özeti ve Çözülmemiş Olaylar (Defect Summary &amp; Unresolved Incidents)</h2>
    <div class="metrics-grid">
      <div class="metric-card">
        <div class="metric-label">Toplam Defect</div>
        <div class="metric-value">{{ defect_summary.total }}</div>
      </div>
      <div class="metric-card">
        <div class="metric-label">Açık / Aktif Defect</div>
        <div class="metric-value">{{ defect_summary.open_total }}</div>
      </div>
      <div class="metric-card">
        <div class="metric-label">Kapatılan (Closed)</div>
        <div class="metric-value">{{ defect_summary.closed_total }}</div>
      </div>
      <div class="metric-card">
        <div class="metric-label">Açık Critical Defect</div>
        <div class="metric-value">{{ defect_summary.open_critical }}</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <table>
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th>Önem Derecesi (Severity)</th>
          <th>Toplam</th>
          <th>Açık (Open / In Progress / Resolved)</th>
          <th>Kapatılan (Closed)</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        {% for row in defect_summary.by_severity %}
        <tr>
          <td><strong>{{ row.severity }}</strong></td>
          <td>{{ row.total }}</td>
          <td>{{ row.open }}</td>
          <td>{{ row.closed }}</td>
        </tr>
        {% endfor %}
      </tbody>
    </table>

    {% if defects %}
    <table>
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th>Defect ID</th>
          <th>Başlık</th>
          <th>Önem</th>
          <th>Durum</th>
          <th>Test Vakası</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        {% for d in defects %}
        <tr>
          <td><strong>#{{ d.id }}</strong></td>
          <td>{{ d.title }}</td>
          <td>{{ d.severity }}</td>
          <td>{{ d.status }}</td>
          <td>{{ d.test_case or "-" }}</td>
        </tr>
        {% endfor %}
      </tbody>
    </table>
    {% endif %}
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>5. Sürüm Çıkış Kriteri Değerlendirmesi ve Muafiyet (Exit Criteria &amp; Release Gate)</h2>
    <table>
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th>Çıkış Kriteri</th>
          <th>Yapılandırılan Eşik (Target)</th>
          <th>Ölçülen Değer (Actual)</th>
          <th>Sonuç</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr>
          <td><strong>Minimum Başarı Oranı (Pass Rate)</strong></td>
          <td>≥ %{{ gate.criteria.min_pass_rate }}</td>
          <td>%{{ gate.actual_pass_rate }}</td>
          <td>{{ "KARŞILANDI" if gate.passed_criteria.pass_rate else "EŞİK ALTINDA" }}</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td><strong>Maksimum Açık Critical Defect</strong></td>
          <td>≤ {{ gate.criteria.max_open_critical }}</td>
          <td>{{ gate.actual_open_critical }}</td>
          <td>{{ "KARŞILANDI" if gate.passed_criteria.open_critical else "LİMİT AŞILDI" }}</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td><strong>Minimum Gereksinim Kapsamı (Requirement Coverage)</strong></td>
          <td>≥ %{{ gate.criteria.min_req_coverage }}</td>
          <td>%{{ gate.actual_req_coverage }}</td>
          <td>{{ "KARŞILANDI" if gate.passed_criteria.req_coverage else "EŞİK ALTINDA" }}</td>
        </tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>

    <div class="section-box">
      <p><strong>Genel Çıkış Kapısı Kararı:</strong> {{ "Çıkış Kapısı Geçti (Ready / Released uygun)" if gate.gate_passed else "Çıkış Kapısı Engelli (Kriterler sağlanmadı ve aktif muafiyet yok)" }}</p>
      {% if gate.waiver %}
      <p>
        <strong>Test Lead / Admin Muafiyet Kaydı (Waiver):</strong>
        {{ gate.waiver.reason }} (Onaylayan: <strong>{{ gate.waiver.waived_by }}</strong> · {{ gate.waiver.waived_at }})
      </p>
      {% else %}
      <p><strong>Muafiyet (Waiver):</strong> Kayıtlı muafiyet yok.</p>
      {% endif %}
    </div>
  </section>

  <footer>
    SDS-06 Agile Test and Defect Tracking System · IEEE 829 Test Summary Report / ISO/IEC/IEEE 29119-3 Test Completion Report · Üreten: {{ generated_by }}
  </footer>
</body>
</html>
